":"c-sanguozhi-055-chengpu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"t-wu051-t-wu051-fu4","person_id":"r9q_7ps_byt","kind":"office","title":"门下贼曹","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本句所載職官，任免時間未詳。","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-fu","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-fu","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-fu:line038-pei01-01","quote":"《江表传》曰：策既平定江东，逐袁胤。袁术深怨策，乃阴遣间使赍印绶与丹杨宗帅陵阳祖郎等，使激动山越，大合众，图共攻策。策自率将士讨郎，生获之。策谓郎曰：“尔昔袭击孤，斫孤马鞍，今创军立事，除弃宿恨，惟取能用，与天下通耳。非但汝，汝莫恐怖。”郎叩头谢罪。即破械，赐衣服，署门下贼曹。及军还，郎与太史慈俱在前导军，人以为荣。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-fu:line038-pei01-01:m0039"}],"attestations":[{"id":"t-wu051-t-wu051-fu4:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-fu:line038-pei01-01","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-fu:line038-pei01-01:m0039","start":134,"end":138,"surface":"门下贼曹","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"person_references":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-fu:line038-pei01-01:r0076","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-fu:line038-pei01-01","start":76,"end":77,"surface":"尔","person_id":"r9q_7ps_byt","referent_role":"addressee","quote":"。策谓郎曰：“尔昔袭击孤，斫孤","note":"依對話說話者、受書者及上下句定位。","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-fu","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-fu"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-wu:line014","text":"景常隨堅征伐有功，拜騎都尉。袁術上景領丹楊太守，討故太守周昕，遂據其郡。孫策與孫河、呂範依景，合眾共討涇縣山賊祖郎。郎敗走。會為劉繇所迫，景復北依術，術以為督軍中郎將，與孫賁共討樊能、於麋於橫江，又擊笮融、薛禮於秣陵。時策被創牛渚，降賊復反，景攻討，盡禽之。從討劉繇，繇奔豫章，策遣景、賁到壽春報術。術方與劉備爭徐州，以景為為廣陵太守。術後僭號。策以書喻術，術不納，便絕江津，不與通，使人告景。景即委郡東歸，策復以景為丹揚太守。漢遣議郎王誧銜命南行，表景為揚武將軍，領郡如故。","text_laye